# Cloudflare Pages response headers (security pass, 2026-08-22).
#
# CSP: script-src is strict - the app's own bundle plus Apple's sign-in JS
# and nothing else, which is what makes the localStorage token defensible
# (DECISIONS 2026-08-21). style-src carries 'unsafe-inline' deliberately:
# the privacy page is a standalone <style> block, and inline CSS is not a
# script-injection surface. connect/img/frame name the API and the R2
# endpoint the presigned URLs point at; a zip download is a navigation and
# needs no grant. frame-ancestors 'none': nothing embeds this app.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://appleid.cdn-apple.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; connect-src 'self' https://api.keptapp.net https://cf54199aef7e9425e000486ce1fda8bb.r2.cloudflarestorage.com; img-src 'self' data: https://cf54199aef7e9425e000486ce1fda8bb.r2.cloudflarestorage.com; frame-src https://cf54199aef7e9425e000486ce1fda8bb.r2.cloudflarestorage.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
